				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Took a while but looks like Emas and I finally are settled in our new home <a href="http://www.pravda-of-norrath.com/" target="_blank" class="postlink">Midwinter</a>. The guild is a little behind 5R but have been nice for me to be at guilds and my first Quarm kill.
<br />

<br />
Grats on complete the Ikk trials very nice indeed <img src="images/smiles/icon_biggrin.gif" alt="Very Happy" border="0" />  I hope my new guild will do more GoD raids as Time get more trivial.
<br />

<br />
We both miss you all, Emas even started to find your equalents here <img src="images/smiles/icon_lol.gif" alt="Laughing" border="0" /> But going from almost 0% attendance to almost 100% you should not count me back on Luclin. The server is low populated and a even mix of Americans and Europeans and I spend less and less time solo/duo. The best part is no VoS not even some close to be as stupid but got our own Asura, Snoozer a jap guild who just did first time RZtW with 34 toons.
<br />

<br />
Hugs
<br />
Sandyar</span><span class="postbody"></span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
